WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.215
Once the materialized view exists consumers can
query the stored summary directly The

00:00:07.242 --> 00:00:13.529
consuming query is simple because the aggregation
has already been computed But

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:17.595
remember that the result is only as fresh as the
last successful refresh
